          "flipV": null,
          "text": "A bachelors degree in engineering \uf0e8 entry level jobsA master\u2019s (minimum) is required for more advanced projects Most flexible degree.  Takes an extra two years after getting a bachelor\u2019s degreeMore advanced engineering pays better \u2013 Excellent investment of timeA PhD is required for very high level projects Can narrow opportunities.  Increases pay in many fields but can take a long time to attain (typically 2-8 years, average of 3-4).Sometimes the monetary pay-off isn\u2019t there \u2013 Succeed or fail quickly is a good strategyEngineers get paid to go to graduate school.  They only take out loans for undergrad."
